    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) as a primary product differentiator has evolved from a foundational architectural commitment in March 2026 to a concrete operational milestone by August. Recent updates from [TanyaTeamowner](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786614422719_1) confirm the successful deployment of the async decision widget, framing this as the realization of the core feature thesis. This progress is linked to a record-breaking sprint performance, where [velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786614422719_2) are being evaluated against [causal attributions](narr:Position_SprintVelocityCausalAttribution) regarding the team's output. The discourse maintains a focus on technical enablement, specifically identifying the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786614422719_3) as the critical unlock for this recent momentum. While the narrative currently aligns product capability with team performance, the tension remains between viewing velocity as a direct output of the new widget versus broader integration efforts.""" ;
